{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル公演も無事\n東京も大阪も終えることが出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい衣装"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"役では、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢村小坊主役"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洋子役"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女中役"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を演じさせて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はレッスンの時に女中役完璧だったので、\n女中マスターと呼ばれていました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから女中を1回でもさせてもらえてよかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに北島文目役も好きでみんなから北島マスターと呼ばれてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドヤッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも何もかもが初めてで、\n最初は演技をするのが恥ずかしい......から始まっていってたのに...\n気がつけば"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今では楽しいと思うようになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして千秋楽での(人はなぜ走るのか)をセンターで踊らせて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い眺めでした。\nまたあの位置に立ちたいと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演中は、声援やタオルや沢山の笑顔...\n可愛くて素敵なお花も送ってくれて、\n写メに残しています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れない!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に皆のおかげでパワーイッパイもらいました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう〜嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この期間で沢山の勉強をし、成長が出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この舞台に携わってくださった方々、本当に有り難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな経験をさせてもらえて、\n一生忘れられない素敵な経験になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして沢山のファンの方々が見に来て下さり最高のステージになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝してもしきれません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動を有り難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精神的にも体力的にもズタボロになったときもあったけど、\n大好きなmemberがいたからここまでこれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな有り難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、乃木坂46大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアーも頑張るぞーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、前前回のブログの写メの答えは...\nかわごちゃんの後ろでした〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たってる方がいてビックリしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくわかりましたね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(^〇^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、横浜の美味しいお店も沢山教えてくれてありがとう♪\nやっぱり中華街ははずせないみたいですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何個もメモしたから、時間があったら沢山行ってみたいな♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有り難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/06/04/9804775/0009.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}